{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPACEROCKS</strong> is an action/adventure game with incremental aspects and heavy ARPG influence. Highly satisfying mining and looting, diverse and powerful upgrades, space factory building  and fast-paced intense combat awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/46e421450312423ecdecbbe57355afc5.webp?t=1771782310\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/4156be6c9d6181194354ce15ab4a5808.poster.avif?t=1771782310\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/4156be6c9d6181194354ce15ab4a5808.webm?t=1771782310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/4156be6c9d6181194354ce15ab4a5808.mp4?t=1771782310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a mining drone gone rogue, your ultimate goal is to build the Wormhole Machine and escape  from the reaches of The Corporation. To accomplish this, you will need many supporting factories constructing the necessary parts and Generators to power them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/155130d9c5414eda1063c3c625fad5e2.webp?t=1771782310\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/0a394d10f1f81637150f3ecc9ad79c72.poster.avif?t=1771782310\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/0a394d10f1f81637150f3ecc9ad79c72.webm?t=1771782310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/0a394d10f1f81637150f3ecc9ad79c72.mp4?t=1771782310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fund this colossal construction project, you will need a vast amount of resources, obtained primarily by blasting asteroids to pieces. You'll also collect rare loot from destroying enemies and random events you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/a99d343281ad8632c8a87baeb8f2fff9.webp?t=1771782310\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/2d1634b138f7fca6c6019c898323839e.poster.avif?t=1771782310\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/2d1634b138f7fca6c6019c898323839e.webm?t=1771782310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/2d1634b138f7fca6c6019c898323839e.mp4?t=1771782310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the relentless assault from your fellow drones, you'll also use your precious mined resources and spoils of combat to upgrade, modify, and boost your ship's power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/5c0f86b6da803b6db6a4cad64edd9aa9.webp?t=1771782310\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong>: Seven procedurally generated areas with infinite asteroids to mine and enemies to blast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong>: 24 different ship components to upgrade individually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modify</strong>: More than 80 ship modifications (and more coming!) which fundamentally change how the ship behaves, or how you will play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct</strong>: Buildings which help you to multiply your resources and accumulate the wealth needed to manufacture Wormhole Machine parts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARPG-Style Looting</strong>: Tons of loot to mine from asteroids and collect from enemies including materials for upgrades/construction, gems which give temporary buffs when used, asteroid cores with randomly rolled upgrades to equip, ship modifications and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game Plus</strong>: Progress through 3 difficulties Diablo 2-style while keeping your upgrades, and find increasingly powerful loot and difficult challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End Game</strong>: Endlessly scaling bosses and other endgame activities await the truly hardcore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stats &amp; Leaderboards</strong>: Track all the numbers from your playthrough in the Statistics panel, and opt-in to the Leaderboards to measure yourself up against other players in dozens of different categories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Guide:</strong>\u00a0Have a question? Open up the guide and dive into a wealth of information on the game's many mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595590?t=1771782310","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/ebd59ff44824cb9962dd67e34f3ab41f57ae484b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771782310","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/40d8753f165ef07ae80d9953bfd6f4d04417add6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771782310","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/40d8753f165ef07ae80d9953bfd6f4d04417add6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771782310","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3785110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPACEROCKS</strong> is an action/adventure game with incremental aspects and heavy ARPG influence. Highly satisfying mining and looting, diverse and powerful upgrades, space factory building  and fast-paced intense combat awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/46e421450312423ecdecbbe57355afc5.webp?t=1771782310\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/4156be6c9d6181194354ce15ab4a5808.poster.avif?t=1771782310\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/4156be6c9d6181194354ce15ab4a5808.webm?t=1771782310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/4156be6c9d6181194354ce15ab4a5808.mp4?t=1771782310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a mining drone gone rogue, your ultimate goal is to build the Wormhole Machine and escape  from the reaches of The Corporation. To accomplish this, you will need many supporting factories constructing the necessary parts and Generators to power them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/155130d9c5414eda1063c3c625fad5e2.webp?t=1771782310\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/0a394d10f1f81637150f3ecc9ad79c72.poster.avif?t=1771782310\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/0a394d10f1f81637150f3ecc9ad79c72.webm?t=1771782310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/0a394d10f1f81637150f3ecc9ad79c72.mp4?t=1771782310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fund this colossal construction project, you will need a vast amount of resources, obtained primarily by blasting asteroids to pieces. You'll also collect rare loot from destroying enemies and random events you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/a99d343281ad8632c8a87baeb8f2fff9.webp?t=1771782310\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/2d1634b138f7fca6c6019c898323839e.poster.avif?t=1771782310\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/2d1634b138f7fca6c6019c898323839e.webm?t=1771782310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/2d1634b138f7fca6c6019c898323839e.mp4?t=1771782310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the relentless assault from your fellow drones, you'll also use your precious mined resources and spoils of combat to upgrade, modify, and boost your ship's power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/extras/5c0f86b6da803b6db6a4cad64edd9aa9.webp?t=1771782310\" width=600 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong>: Seven procedurally generated areas with infinite asteroids to mine and enemies to blast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade</strong>: 24 different ship components to upgrade individually.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modify</strong>: More than 80 ship modifications (and more coming!) which fundamentally change how the ship behaves, or how you will play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct</strong>: Buildings which help you to multiply your resources and accumulate the wealth needed to manufacture Wormhole Machine parts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARPG-Style Looting</strong>: Tons of loot to mine from asteroids and collect from enemies including materials for upgrades/construction, gems which give temporary buffs when used, asteroid cores with randomly rolled upgrades to equip, ship modifications and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game Plus</strong>: Progress through 3 difficulties Diablo 2-style while keeping your upgrades, and find increasingly powerful loot and difficult challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>End Game</strong>: Endlessly scaling bosses and other endgame activities await the truly hardcore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stats &amp; Leaderboards</strong>: Track all the numbers from your playthrough in the Statistics panel, and opt-in to the Leaderboards to measure yourself up against other players in dozens of different categories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Guide:</strong>\u00a0Have a question? Open up the guide and dive into a wealth of information on the game's many mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Super-V"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595590/cd257d058bfc1e807ddb9c141742da1ea774d7e1/header.jpg?t=1771782310","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3595590/615670376/2e52ee9b6c04ac4585db900c96eeb0009cc96897/1754601560/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754656526","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3595590/615670376/2e52ee9b6c04ac4585db900c96eeb0009cc96897/1754601560/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754656526","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3595590/615670376/2e52ee9b6c04ac4585db900c96eeb0009cc96897/1754601560/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754656526","id":257